    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "*‖ b-Ax ‖₂ < * ‖ b-Ax₀ ‖₂ + `atol`* indicates convergence.",
      "ko": "*‖ b-Ax ‖₂ < * ‖ b-Ax₀ ‖₂ + `atol`*는 수렴을 나타냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5f9abb48a04f1748a06cc7f6c05222be78f6da02809195c05416e6f53a29ce4b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "If [`rtol`](sparsecgoptions/rtol.md) is equal to `0`, the operation uses the default value of `sqrt(epsilon)`.",
      "ko": "[`rtol`](sparsecgoptions/rtol.md)가 `0`이면 작업은 `sqrt(epsilon)`의 기본값을 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "160f9e88f2015cdb906c69b815853301b332a27c329adbfebd2bede9e0e021aa",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "If it’s negative, the operation treats [`rtol`](sparsecgoptions/rtol.md) as `0.0` (it doesn’t use the default).",
      "ko": "음수인 경우 작업은 [`rtol`](sparsecgoptions/rtol.md)를 `0.0`으로 처리합니다(기본값을 사용하지 않습니다).",
      "sourceHash": "081c70fe5b835ecc6a73bde230c4b413415f7bb42905b7ab9f664bc69320438f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
